">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$135</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dye</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.60.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 28th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h4><span id=\".22Flip.2C_flip.2C_flip.2C_flip.._I.27m_a_tuuuuumbleeeeeweeeeeeeed.21.21.22\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&quot;Flip,_flip,_flip,_flip.._I'm_a_tuuuuumbleeeeeweeeeeeeed!!&quot;\"><i>\"Flip, flip, flip, flip.. I'm a tuuuuumbleeeeeweeeeeeeed!!\"</i></span></h4>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Tumbleweed is a \"flower\" that can be found rolling in the Oke Desert in <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>. You can sell it for $135, or sell its dye for $540.\n</p><p>When put into a <a href=\"/wiki/Composter\" title=\"Composter\">Composter</a>, the fill level instantly fills to 100%, being the largest amount given by a single plant.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163710\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 52/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 62/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019403/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.642      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   30.642      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3004-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163710 and revision id 14854. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Flower"],"links":[{"title":"Ferwater Island","exists":true},{"title":"Composter","exists":true}],"images":["Tumbleweed.png"]}
